required.
MESSAGE TYPE ::message_type_name
Specifies the message type on which the permission is being granted. The scope qualifier "::" is
required.
REMOTE SERVICE BINDING ::remote_binding_name
Specifies the remote service binding on which the permission is being granted. The scope
