    55714,
    '### GO

Permissions
Examples
A. Grant SELECT permission on a view

<!-- PAGE 30527 -->

The following example grants the SQL Server login Sylvester1  permission to select a view that
lists SQL Server logins. The example then grants the extra permission that is required to view
