    55762,
    '### GO

EXECUTE dbo.usp_myproc;   
Using REVERT WITH COOKIE
Permissions
Examples
A. Using EXECUTE AS and REVERT to switch context

<!-- PAGE 30544 -->

The following example creates a context execution stack by using multiple principals. The REVERT
statement is then used to reset the execution context to the previous caller. The REVERT
