B. Using the WITH COOKIE clause

<!-- PAGE 30545 -->

The following example sets the execution context of a session to a specified user and specifies
the WITH NO REVERT COOKIE = @varbinary_variable clause. The REVERT  statement must specify
the value passed to the @cookie  variable in the EXECUTE AS  statement to successfully revert the
context back to the caller. To run this example, the login1  login and user1  user created in
example A must exist.',
