    56136,
    '### CASCADE

Indicates that the permission being revoked is also revoked from other principals to which it
has been granted or denied by this principal.
AS SQL_Server_login
Specifies the SQL Server login from which the principal executing this query derives its right to
revoke the permission.
） Important
If the principal has the specified permission without the GRANT option, the permission
itself will be revoked.
Ｕ Caution
A cascaded revocation of a permission granted WITH GRANT OPTION will revoke both
```sql
GRANT and DENY of that permission.
```

Remarks

<!-- PAGE 30612 -->

SQL Server logins and server roles are server-level securables. The most specific and limited
permissions that can be revoked on a SQL Server login or server role are listed in the following
table, together with the more general permissions that include them by implication.
SQL Server login or server role
permission
Implied by SQL Server login or server
role permission
Implied by server
permission',
