    '### SQL

Permissions
Examples
A. Beginning a dialog
DECLARE @dialog_handle UNIQUEIDENTIFIER ;  

BEGIN DIALOG CONVERSATION @dialog_handle  
   FROM SERVICE [//Adventure-Works.com/ExpenseClient]  

<!-- PAGE 30643 -->

The following example begins a dialog conversation and stores an identifier for the dialog in
@dialog_handle . The //Adventure-Works.com/ExpenseClient  service is the initiator for the
dialog, and the //Adventure-Works.com/Expenses  service is the target of the dialog. The dialog
follows the contract //Adventure-Works.com/Expenses/ExpenseSubmission . If the dialog has not
been closed by the END CONVERSATION command within 60  seconds, the broker ends the
dialog with an error.',
