    56250,
    '### SQL)

Article • 09/03/2024
Applies to:  SQL Server  Azure SQL Managed Instance
Returns the conversation group identifier for the next message to be received, and locks the
conversation group for the conversation that contains the message. The conversation group
identifier can be used to retrieve conversation state information before retrieving the message
itself.
 Transact-SQL syntax conventions
