    56251,
    '### WAITFOR

Specifies that the GET CONVERSATION GROUP statement waits for a message to arrive on the
queue if no messages are currently present.
@conversation_group_id
Is a variable used to store the conversation group ID returned by the GET CONVERSATION
GROUP statement. The variable must be of type uniqueidentifier. If there are no conversation
groups available, the variable is set to NULL.',
    '{"section": "WAITFOR", "page_anchor": "PAGE 30650", "char_length": 395}'::jsonb,
