service_contract_name nvarchar(128) Name of the contract that the conversation follows.
service_contract_id int SQL Server object identifier of the contract that the
conversation follows.
message_type_name nvarchar(128) Name of the message type that describes the format of the
message. Messages can be either application message
types or Broker system messages.
message_type_id int SQL Server object identifier of the message type that
describes the message.
validation nchar(2) Validation used for the message.
