    56270,
    '### SQL

The following example receives all available messages for the next available conversation
group from the ExpenseQueue  queue. The statement returns the messages as a result set that
Permissions
Examples
A. Receive all columns for all messages in a conversation
group
RECEIVE * FROM ExpenseQueue ;  
B. Receive specified columns for all messages in a
conversation group

<!-- PAGE 30664 -->

contains the columns conversation_handle , message_type_name , and message_body .',
