    '### SQL

The following example receives the next available message for the next available conversation
group in the ExpenseQueue  queue. When the message is of type //Adventure-
Works.com/Expenses/SubmitExpense , the statement extracts the employee ID and a list of items
from the message body. The statement also retrieves state for the conversation from the
ConversationState  table.
    FROM ExpenseQueue) ;  
H. Receive messages and waiting for a specified interval',
