INSERT INTO document_chunks (id, source_file, chunk_index, content, metadata, embedding)
VALUES (
    'chunk_a080ae4a4592',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    56439,
    '### SET ANSI_NULLS ON


<!-- PAGE 30690 -->

When ANSI_NULLS  is ON, a SELECT  statement that uses WHERE column_name = NULL  returns zero
rows even if there are NULL values in column_name. A SELECT  statement that uses WHERE
column_name <> NULL  returns zero rows even if there are non-NULL values in column_name.
When ANSI_NULLS is OFF, the Equals (= ) and Not Equal To (<> ) comparison operators do not
follow the ISO standard. A SELECT  statement that uses WHERE column_name = NULL  returns the
rows that have null values in column_name. A SELECT  statement that uses WHERE column_name <>
NULL  returns the rows that have non-NULL  values in the column. Also, a SELECT  statement that
uses WHERE column_name <> XYZ_value  returns all rows that are not XYZ_value and that are not',
