    '### SET CONCAT_NULL_YIELDS_NULL

(Transact-SQL)
Applies to:  SQL Server  Azure SQL Managed Instance  Azure Synapse Analytics 
Analytics Platform System (PDW)  SQL analytics endpoint in Microsoft Fabric  Warehouse
in Microsoft Fabric
Controls whether concatenation results are treated as null or empty string values.
 Transact-SQL syntax conventions
syntaxsql
syntaxsql
When SET CONCAT_NULL_YIELDS_NULL is ON, concatenating a null value with a string yields a
NULL result. For example, SELECT ''abc'' + NULL  yields NULL . When SET',
