    '### SQL

Here is the message output:
Output
SET Statements (Transact-SQL)
SET SHOWPLAN_ALL (Transact-SQL)
SET STATISTICS TIME (Transact-SQL)
When Transact-SQL statements retrieve LOB columns, some LOB retrieval operations might
require traversing the LOB tree multiple times. This can cause SET STATISTICS IO to report
higher than expected logical reads.
Permissions
Examples
