INSERT INTO document_chunks (id, source_file, chunk_index, content, metadata, embedding)
VALUES (
    'chunk_8c9998f693ea',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    57220,
    '### XML

Sorting in XQuery is performed by using the order by  clause in the FLWOR expression. The
sorting expressions passed to the order by  clause must return values whose types are valid for
the gt  operator. Each sorting expression must result in a singleton a sequence with one item.
By default, sorting is performed in ascending order. You can optionally specify ascending or
descending order for each sorting expression.
The following query retrieves all the telephone numbers for a specific customer from the
