Validate Expressions (XQuery)
Article • 02/28/2023
Applies to:  SQL Server
In this implementation, the validate expression is not supported. The results of XQuery
construction expressions are always untyped. If the result of an XQuery expression should be
typed, use the SQL CAST expression to cast the result to an xml data type with the preferred
schema collection.
