INSERT INTO document_chunks (id, source_file, chunk_index, content, metadata, embedding)
VALUES (
    'chunk_87c23115fea4',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    57263,
    '### SQL

The following query is specified against the Instructions column, typed xml column, of the
ProductModel table. The expression returns all the element children of the <root > element
whose local name part of the QName is "Location" . The local-name()  function is specified in
