    '### SQL

DECLARE @x AS XML;
SET @x = '''';
```sql
SELECT @x.query(''data(<SomeNode>value</SomeNode>)'');
```

Examples
A. Use the data() XQuery function to extract typed value of a
node
WITH XMLNAMESPACES (''https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ProductModelDescription'' AS p1, 
''https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ProductModelWarrAndMain'' AS wm)
```sql
SELECT CatalogDescription.query(N''
```

 for $pd in //p1:ProductDescription
 return
    <Root
      ProductID = "{ data( ($pd//@ProductModelID)[1] ) }"

<!-- PAGE 31053 -->

