VALUES (
    'chunk_0cb860da319b',
    'converted_sql-sql-server-ver17.md',
    57286,
    '### SQL

The following examples illustrate instances in which the data()  function is required.
In the following query, $pd/p1:Specifications/Material  returns the <Material > element. Also,
data($pd/p1:Specifications/ Material)  returns character data typed as xdt:untypedAtomic ,
because <Material > is untyped. When the input is untyped, the result of data()  is typed as
