    '### XML

The following query retrieves additional telephone numbers for a specific customer contact by
searching the whole hierarchy for the <telephoneNumber > element. Because the
<telephoneNumber > element can appear anywhere in the hierarchy, the query uses the
descendant and self operator (//) in the search.',
