    57316,
    '### XML

To retrieve only the top-level telephone numbers, specifically the <telephoneNumber > child
elements of <AdditionalContactInfo >, the FOR expression in the query changes to
for $ph in /ci:AdditionalContactInfo/act:telephoneNumber .
XQuery Basics
XML Construction (XQuery)
XML Data (SQL Server)
 declare namespace act="https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ContactTypes";  
for $ph in /ci:AdditionalContactInfo//act:telephoneNumber  
   return  
      $ph/act:number  
'') as x  
FROM  Person.Contact  
WHERE ContactID = 1  
\<act:number   
  xmlns:act="https://schemas.microsoft.com/sqlserver/2004/07/adventure-
works/ContactTypes">  
  111-111-1111  
\</act:number>  
